    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（20山东）甲、乙两人在一条400米的环形跑道上从相距200米的位置出发，同向匀速跑步。当甲第三次追上乙的时候，乙跑了2000米。问甲的速度是乙的多少倍？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1.2"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1.6"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "2.0"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          73
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          67
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-02-p073.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第67页",
            "pdfPage": 73
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先数相对路程：两人初始相隔200米，甲第1次追回200米；第2、3次各再追回400米，所以第3次追上时累计多跑1000米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "这时乙跑2000米，甲跑3000米，同时间速度比为3000/2000＝1.5，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "起点不同先单列第一次的初始间距，后续每次才加整圈。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
