    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）甲和乙从全长n米的环形跑道上某一点同时匀速出发，如两人同向跑步，则甲第一次追上乙的用时是两人反向跑步第一次相遇用时的8倍。如两人反向跑步，那么第一次相遇时乙跑了多少米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "n/8"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "n/16"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3n/8"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "7n/16"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          73
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          67
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-03-p073.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 母题精讲3 · 讲义第67页",
            "pdfPage": 73
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t01-mother-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设甲乙速度为a、b，甲较快。同起点同向追上需n/(a－b)，反向第一次相遇需n/(a＋b)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "前者为后者的8倍，所以a＋b＝8(a－b)，得7a＝9b，也就是甲∶乙＝9∶7。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "反向相遇共同走一圈，乙走其中7/16，即7n/16米，选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "相遇与追及时间之比要先转成速度和与速度差的关系。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
